; Fish: queue the sprite after the animation step
;
; Continuation of #R$B870 after #R$A883. HL points to the sprite block + 1 and E is the frame number: #R$B6D9 makes
; the draw command from them and queues it.
;
; E Frame number
; HL Sprite block + 1
@label=UpdateFish_Queue
c$B87D JP $B6D9      ; queue the sprite of the frame
